sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as PublisherSpout
    participant B1 as BrokerBolt 1<br/>(~N/3 local subs)
    participant B2 as BrokerBolt 2<br/>(~N/3 local subs)
    participant B3 as BrokerBolt 3<br/>(~N/3 local subs)
    participant N as NotifierBolts

    Note over P: Reads one publication<br/>{stationid, city, temp, wind}
    P->>B1: emit (allGrouping → copy 1)
    P->>B2: emit (allGrouping → copy 2)
    P->>B3: emit (allGrouping → copy 3)
    
    Note over B2: Hash ring simulation
    par Broker 1 matches locally
        B1->>B1: scan local subscriptions<br/>evaluate predicates
        B1-->>N: 1 tuple per match
    and Broker 2 matches locally
        B2->>B2: scan local subscriptions
        B2-->>N: 1 tuple per match
    and Broker 3 matches locally
        B3->>B3: scan local subscriptions
        B3-->>N: 1 tuple per match
    end

    Note over N: Increment Stats.match_number<br/>Increment Stats.publications_number<br/>Accumulate latency